commit fff915bd8a0a53eb6e48dc6a26687ba66e7891e4
Author: jollyroger1480 <jollyroger1480@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 2 07:40:39 2026 -0500

    gfx803 (Polaris) experimental support: STRATA_HIP_GFX803 option
    
    - STRATA_HIP_GFX803 CMake option: dp4a byte-mad emulation (dp4a.hpp),
      wave64 MMVQ layout gates extended from GFX906 to GFX803 (native_mmvq.cu),
      iq4 table lookup via v_perm, gfx900/gfx803 on the unvalidated arch list,
      qsa_decode_attn.cu + s26_tsum.cuh excluded (need gfx10+ insts)
    - mmvq_il_parity: STRATA_IL_HIP_BUILD guard for the L2 persist window +
      magnitude readout on the FAIL line (maxabs/maxrel)
    - Verified on a real RX 480 through the COV4 bridge (rapier docs/BUILD.md):
      T=1 bitwise, IL arms reorder-noise only, office fast brain runs 64K ctx
      on 4 GB

